sequenceDiagram
    participant Pipeline as CI/CD Pipeline
    participant CFN as AWS CloudFormation
    participant Custom as Custom Resource (Lambda)
    participant External as External SaaS (e.g., Datadog)
    
    Pipeline->>CFN: CreateStack
    CFN->>Custom: Invoke Lambda (RequestType: Create)
    Custom->>External: API Call (Create Monitor)
    External-->>Custom: Success (Monitor ID)
    Custom->>CFN: HTTP PUT (Status: SUCCESS, PhysicalResourceId)
    CFN-->>Pipeline: Stack CREATE_COMPLETE
